---@field ruleType azure.billingbenefits.DiscountRuleType|string The type of the priceable node pricing rule. Validation: Required. Supported values are fixedPriceLock, fixedListPrice, and priceCeiling.
---@field catalogId string The catalog instance where the priceable node lives. Validation: Required. No defined format, will vary per team.
---@field catalogClaims azure.billingbenefits.CustomPricePropertiesCatalogClaimsList The set of BigCat claims. Validation: Required. Must contain AgreementType, NationalCloud, and PricingAudience claims. Additionally requires AccessPass claim when creating custom price with action == consume on the pricing instructions.
---@field termUnits? string The term units for the priceable node. Validation: Optional, Maximum length 128 characters. Must be present if and only if the availability derived by market, product, sku, and claims has terms.
---@field billingPeriod? string The billing period of the priceable node. Validation: Optional, Maximum length 128 characters. Only allowed if the availability derived by market, product, sku, and claims has terms and at least one of those terms has a billing period. When specified, termUnits must be specified.
---@field meterType? string Must be present if the market, product, sku, and claims, and optional term information resolves to multiple availabilities that only differ by meter type. Validation: Maximum length 128 characters.
---@field marketSetPrices azure.billingbenefits.CustomPricePropertiesMarketSetPricesList The set of market set prices of the priceable node. Validation: Required. Must contain at least one element.

